# The main menu's game options with the UPGRADES line shown (players see it;
# every other run hides it): the line under the original's six, the page it
# opens (Tactical/TacticalControl.cpp, OpenUpgradesPage), a switch turned on
# there, Done, and the menu back as it was. In test mode the switch is
# turned for the run alone: nothing is saved.
# upgrades-line: shown
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right Right idle:50 Return idle:300 @snap:options
Down Down Down Down Down Down idle:100 @snap:line
Return idle:300 @snap:page
Return idle:300 @snap:switched
Down Down Down Down Return idle:300 @snap:back
Escape idle:300 @snap:done
